  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "Despite its significance, OH remains largely unintegrated into national governance and service delivery structures, with limited coordination across human health, animal health and environmental sectors [14], and only a few countries demonstrating uneven progress toward cross-sectoral integration [16]. As a result, there remains limited clarity on how governance arrangements, financing mechanisms, workforce capacity and institutional coordination collectively influence the integration of OH into national health systems.",
      "reason": "The text describes the current state of knowledge on OH integration and identifies important uncertainties and gaps."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "Accordingly, this systematic review synthesizes global evidence on the challenges and opportunities of integrating OH into national health systems across human, animal and environmental sectors and identifies actionable system-level strategies to support sustainable integration.",
      "reason": "The text explains the importance and need for conducting the review to address systemic patterns and provide comparative synthesis."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "More recent reviews published in 2025 [30-32] have examined operational challenges in rural African contexts, ethical considerations within a globalized OH framework and critical reflections from the Global South. Although these contributions broaden thematic and regional understanding, they primarily focus on conceptual or context-specific dimensions rather than systematically analysing how implementation barriers and facilitators intersect with core health system functions.",
      "reason": "The text cites previous reviews and explains the need for the current review to fill a gap in systematic analysis."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review synthesizes challenges and opportunities, not intervention effects, so describing mechanism of action does not apply."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review is not focused on complex interventions or delivery contexts, so considering a logic model does not apply."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
}

